- Verified: `/workspace/task_env/flat_combine_combiner_recv_inductive_verified.rs`

## Compliance

- All existing `admit()` calls preserved
- No changes to executable code
- No changes to pre/post conditions
- No new proof holes introduced
- Lynette checks pass for both files
